  "scope": {
    "kind": "inline",
    "value": "Four original AP11 block tests, the independent AP13 hinge and eleven original linear costs each use216 common raw-source, actual-survivor and complete extra-deletion LP, with no external subtraction from the retained LP. Earlier raw-source candidates use the complete explicit whole-hinge deletion lower bound. All original residues and both seven depths remain. The uniform h4 result also feeds202 exact identities on each separate numerator test. Every original count tail,52 costs, signed mass and complete square remains on both whole saturated actual K faces. No shared optimizer across tests, positive load-two mass, actual attainment, off-face/global extension, Lean or unrestricted Erdos7 resolution."
